exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
Invalid value for positional parameter at index 0 (REGION): 'mars' is not a valid market; valid values: us, gb, asia, europe, rates, commodities, currencies, cryptocurrencies
Usage: yfin market [-hV] [--no-cache] [--no-color] [--status] [--verbose]
                   [--format=FORMAT] [--retries=N] [--timeout=DURATION] REGION
Headline instruments or trading hours of a market region.
      REGION               Market region: us, gb, asia, europe, rates,
                             commodities, currencies or cryptocurrencies.
      --format=FORMAT      Output format: table, csv or json (default: table).
  -h, --help               Show this help message and exit.
      --no-cache           Don't read or write the on-disk cache (cookie,
                             crumb, timezones).
      --no-color           Never colour table output.
      --retries=N          Retries on rate limits and server errors; 0 disables
                             (default: 2).
      --status             Print today's trading hours instead (us only).
      --timeout=DURATION   Timeout per request, e.g. 30s or 2m (default: 30s).
  -V, --version            Print version information and exit.
      --verbose            Print the cause chain of errors and stack traces of
                             unexpected ones.
